exports[`contract compiler — snapshots > markdown sections per endpoint 1`] = `
[
  {
    "id": "health",
    "markdown": "### GET /health

**Auth:** None

Liveness + identity probe. Always available, no auth. Returns 200 for healthy/degraded, 503 for unhealthy.

**Response:**

| Field | Type | Required | Description |
| ----- | ---- | -------- | ----------- |
| \`status\` | \`healthy\` \\| \`degraded\` \\| \`unhealthy\` | Yes | Overall product health. Maps to HTTP 200 (healthy/degraded) or 503 (unhealthy). |
| \`version\` | string | Yes | Product semver string (e.g. '2.1.0'). |
| \`product\` | string | Yes | Lowercase product slug. MUST match product.id in manifest. |
| \`uptime_seconds\` | number | No | Seconds since the process started. |
| \`checks\` | object<string, any> | No | Sub-system health states (database, cache, queues, ...). |
",
  },
  {
    "id": "god-mode-tools",
    "markdown": "### GET /api/v1/god-mode/tools

**Auth:** Bearer token

Lists every God Mode tool this product exposes. Brainstorm CLI calls this at boot to register tools with the agent loop and MCP server.

**Response:**

| Field | Type | Required | Description |
| ----- | ---- | -------- | ----------- |
| \`product\` | string | Yes | Product slug. Matches /health.product. |
| \`version\` | string | Yes | Product semver. |
| \`tool_count\` | number | Yes |  |
| \`tools\` | array<object> | Yes |  |
",
  },
  {
    "id": "god-mode-execute",
    "markdown": "### POST /api/v1/god-mode/execute

**Auth:** Bearer token

Invokes a single God Mode tool. If the tool requires a ChangeSet and the request has simulate=true, returns the simulation; otherwise executes and returns the result.

**Request body:**

| Field | Type | Required | Description |
| ----- | ---- | -------- | ----------- |
| \`tool\` | string | Yes | Fully-qualified tool name. |
| \`params\` | object<string, any> | Yes | Tool-specific parameter object. |
| \`simulate\` | boolean | No | When true and the tool requires_changeset, returns a simulation rather than executing. |
| \`correlation_id\` | string | No | Optional client-provided UUID for request correlation. |
| \`idempotency_key\` | string | No | If present, repeated requests with the same key return cached result or 409. |

**Response:**

| Field | Type | Required | Description |
| ----- | ---- | -------- | ----------- |
| \`success\` | \`true\` | Yes |  |
| \`tool\` | string | Yes |  |
| \`data\` | any | No | Tool-specific success payload. |
| \`risk_level\` | \`read_only\` \\| \`low\` \\| \`medium\` \\| \`high\` \\| \`critical\` | Yes |  |
| \`trace_id\` | string | Yes | Server-side trace identifier for audit. |
| \`evidence_id\` | string | No | Reference to a stored evidence record, when applicable. |

**Alternate response (simulation):**

| Field | Type | Required | Description |
| ----- | ---- | -------- | ----------- |
| \`success\` | \`true\` | Yes |  |
| \`tool\` | string | Yes |  |
| \`simulation\` | object | Yes |  |
| \`changes\` | array<object> | Yes |  |
| \`description\` | string | Yes |  |
| \`risk_level\` | \`read_only\` \\| \`low\` \\| \`medium\` \\| \`high\` \\| \`critical\` | Yes |  |
| \`trace_id\` | string | Yes |  |

**Alternate response (error):**

| Field | Type | Required | Description |
| ----- | ---- | -------- | ----------- |
| \`success\` | \`false\` | Yes |  |
| \`error\` | object | Yes |  |
| \`tool\` | string | Yes |  |
| \`trace_id\` | string | Yes |  |
",
  },
  {
    "id": "platform-events",
    "markdown": "### POST /api/v1/platform/events

**Auth:** Bearer token

Inbound platform event endpoint. Receiver MUST verify the HMAC signature against the per-tenant derived key before processing.

**Request body:**

| Field | Type | Required | Description |
| ----- | ---- | -------- | ----------- |
| \`id\` | string | Yes | UUIDv7 event identifier. |
| \`type\` | string | Yes | \`{product}.{noun}.{past_verb}\` event type. |
| \`tenant_id\` | string | Yes |  |
| \`product\` | string | Yes |  |
| \`timestamp\` | string | Yes |  |
| \`data\` | object<string, any> | Yes | Event-specific payload. |
| \`schema_version\` | number | Yes |  |
| \`correlation_id\` | string | No |  |
| \`signature\` | string | Yes | HMAC-SHA256 of canonical JSON (event minus signature field) signed with the per-tenant derived key. |

**Response:**

| Field | Type | Required | Description |
| ----- | ---- | -------- | ----------- |
| \`accepted\` | boolean | Yes |  |
| \`handled\` | boolean | Yes |  |
",
  },
  {
    "id": "platform-tenants",
    "markdown": "### POST /api/v1/platform/tenants

**Auth:** Bearer token

Tenant provisioning + deprovisioning. Deprovision is a soft-delete with 30-day retention.

**Request body:**

| Field | Type | Required | Description |
| ----- | ---- | -------- | ----------- |
| \`tenant_id\` | string | Yes |  |
| \`action\` | \`provision\` \\| \`deprovision\` | Yes |  |
| \`product_config\` | object<string, any> | No |  |
| \`idempotency_key\` | string | Yes |  |

**Response:**

| Field | Type | Required | Description |
| ----- | ---- | -------- | ----------- |
| \`success\` | boolean | Yes |  |
| \`tenant_id\` | string | Yes |  |
| \`state\` | \`provisioned\` \\| \`deprovisioned\` \\| \`pending\` | Yes |  |
",
  },
]
`;

